IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ktv-nouns`
IMPORT `ktv-annex1-definitions`
IMPORT `ktv-part1-benefits`
IMPORT `ktv-part3-exclusions-and-termination`
IMPORT `ktv-assessment`

-- Tests for Part I (Articles 1-10), Articles 23-24, and claims assessed end to end. Every
-- expected value was worked by hand from the source before it was written; the worked
-- arithmetic is in the comment above each group.

§ `Tests — benefits, exclusions, termination, and claims`

§§ `Fixtures`

`the insured` MEANS `Insured person` WITH
    `date of birth`                                       IS YMD 1980 6 10
    `sex`                                                 IS `male`
    `living in Vietnam when the application was submitted` IS TRUE
    `one in whom the policyowner has an insurable interest` IS TRUE
    `accepted for insurance by the Company`               IS TRUE

`the policyowner` MEANS Policyowner WITH
    `kind`                                            IS `an individual`
    `age in completed years`                          IS 42
    `full civil legal capacity`                       IS TRUE
    `lawfully established and operating in Vietnam`   IS FALSE
    `alive`                                           IS TRUE

GIVEN `the reinstatement` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A Policy
`the policy, reinstated:` `the reinstatement` MEANS Policy WITH
    `effective date`                           IS YMD 2022 3 15
    `date the Company accepted the insurance`  IS YMD 2022 3 20
    `date of the latest reinstatement`         IS `the reinstatement`
    `premium frequency`                        IS `yearly`
    `the insured`                              IS `the insured`
    `the policyowner`                          IS `the policyowner`

`the policy` MEANS `the policy, reinstated:` NOTHING

GIVEN `sum insured` IS A NUMBER
      `basic`       IS A NUMBER
      `top-up`      IS A NUMBER
      `debts`       IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Account snapshot`
`an account of sum insured` `sum insured` `, basic` `basic` `, top-up` `top-up` `, debts` `debts` MEANS `Account snapshot` WITH
    `sum insured`                IS `sum insured`
    `basic account value`        IS `basic`
    `top-up account value`       IS `top-up`
    `debts`                      IS `debts`
    `annualised basic premium`   IS 20000000

`one billion` MEANS 1000 TIMES 1000000
`one million` MEANS 1000000

`the account` MEANS `an account of sum insured` `one billion` `, basic` (200 TIMES `one million`) `, top-up` (50 TIMES `one million`) `, debts` 0

`no circumstances` MEANS `Circumstances of the insured event` WITH
    `suicide by the insured`                                                IS FALSE
    `acts of insurance fraud`                                               IS EMPTY
    `a breach of the law on alcohol concentration`                          IS FALSE
    `use of narcotics without a doctor's prescription`                      IS FALSE
    `use of medicine without a doctor's prescription`                       IS FALSE
    `fighting or resisting arrest by a competent authority`                 IS FALSE
    `self-inflicted injury`                                                 IS FALSE
    `a sport or recreational activity`                                      IS NOTHING
    `air travel`                                                            IS FALSE
    `as passenger or crew on a licensed, regularly scheduled commercial flight` IS FALSE

GIVEN `suicide`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `alcohol`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `medicine` IS A BOOLEAN
      `activity` IS A MAYBE `Sport or recreational activity`
      `air`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `scheduled` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Circumstances of the insured event`
`circumstances: suicide` `suicide` `, alcohol` `alcohol` `, medicine` `medicine` `, activity` `activity` `, air` `air` `, scheduled` `scheduled` MEANS `Circumstances of the insured event` WITH
    `suicide by the insured`                                                IS `suicide`
    `acts of insurance fraud`                                               IS EMPTY
    `a breach of the law on alcohol concentration`                          IS `alcohol`
    `use of narcotics without a doctor's prescription`                      IS FALSE
    `use of medicine without a doctor's prescription`                       IS `medicine`
    `fighting or resisting arrest by a competent authority`                 IS FALSE
    `self-inflicted injury`                                                 IS FALSE
    `a sport or recreational activity`                                      IS `activity`
    `air travel`                                                            IS `air`
    `as passenger or crew on a licensed, regularly scheduled commercial flight` IS `scheduled`

GIVEN `the fraudster` IS A `Person who can commit insurance fraud`
GIVETH A `Circumstances of the insured event`
`fraud by` `the fraudster` MEANS `Circumstances of the insured event` WITH
    `suicide by the insured`                                                IS FALSE
    `acts of insurance fraud`                                               IS LIST (`Act of insurance fraud` WITH `committed by` IS `the fraudster`, `using forged documents or deliberately falsifying the claim file` IS TRUE, `harming the life or health of the insured to claim a benefit` IS FALSE)
    `a breach of the law on alcohol concentration`                          IS FALSE
    `use of narcotics without a doctor's prescription`                      IS FALSE
    `use of medicine without a doctor's prescription`                       IS FALSE
    `fighting or resisting arrest by a competent authority`                 IS FALSE
    `self-inflicted injury`                                                 IS FALSE
    `a sport or recreational activity`                                      IS NOTHING
    `air travel`                                                            IS FALSE
    `as passenger or crew on a licensed, regularly scheduled commercial flight` IS FALSE

GIVEN `the benefit` IS A Benefit
      `the amount`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Payment already made`
`paid` `the benefit` `of` `the amount` MEANS `Payment already made` WITH `the benefit` IS `the benefit`, `the amount` IS `the amount`

`early cancer paid 300 million` MEANS `paid` (`the cancer benefit for` `early-stage cancer`) `of` (300 TIMES `one million`)

§§ `Articles 1 and 2 — the advance payments (src 54-116, 132-152)`

-- 30% of 1 billion is 300 million, under the 500 million cap.
#ASSERT `Article 1(a) — the cancer benefit for` `early-stage cancer` `, on` `the account` `after` EMPTY EQUALS 300 TIMES `one million`
#ASSERT `Article 1(a) — the cancer benefit for` `carcinoma in situ` `, on` `the account` `after` EMPTY EQUALS 300 TIMES `one million`
-- 30% of 1.6 billion is 480 million; of 1.7 billion, 510 million, capped at 500 million.
#ASSERT `Article 2(a)(i) — the early-stage critical illness benefit on` (`an account of sum insured` (1600 TIMES `one million`) `, basic` 0 `, top-up` 0 `, debts` 0) EQUALS 480 TIMES `one million`
#ASSERT `Article 2(a)(i) — the early-stage critical illness benefit on` (`an account of sum insured` (1700 TIMES `one million`) `, basic` 0 `, top-up` 0 `, debts` 0) EQUALS 500 TIMES `one million`

§§ `The main benefit formula — major cancer, severe-stage illness, TPD, death (src 85-108, 140-152, 307-327)`

-- max(1 000m, 200m) + 50m - 300m paid - 0 debts = 750m.
#ASSERT `Article 1(a) — the cancer benefit for` `major cancer` `, on` `the account` `after` (LIST `early cancer paid 300 million`) EQUALS 750 TIMES `one million`
-- The basic account above the sum insured: max(1 000m, 1 200m) + 50m = 1 250m.
#ASSERT `Article 2(a)(ii) — the severe-stage critical illness benefit on` (`an account of sum insured` `one billion` `, basic` (1200 TIMES `one million`) `, top-up` (50 TIMES `one million`) `, debts` 0) `after` EMPTY EQUALS 1250 TIMES `one million`
-- Debts come off: 1 000m + 50m - 0 - 30m = 1 020m.
#ASSERT `Article 6(a) — the TPD or death benefit on` (`an account of sum insured` `one billion` `, basic` (200 TIMES `one million`) `, top-up` (50 TIMES `one million`) `, debts` (30 TIMES `one million`)) `after` EMPTY EQUALS 1020 TIMES `one million`
-- The ICU and premium-support benefits are not deducted (Articles 3(b)(ii), 4(c)).
#ASSERT `Article 6(a) — the TPD or death benefit on` `the account` `after` (LIST (`paid` `the ICU benefit` `of` (300 TIMES `one million`)), (`paid` `the premium-support benefit` `of` (40 TIMES `one million`))) EQUALS 1050 TIMES `one million`
#ASSERT `Article 1(a) — the cancer benefit for` `extended major cancer` `, on` `the account` `after` EMPTY EQUALS `one billion`

§§ `Article 1(b), 2(b) — once each (src 118-119, 158-159)`

#ASSERT NOT `Article 1(b) — the cancer benefit for` `early-stage cancer` `has not yet been paid in` (LIST `early cancer paid 300 million`)
#ASSERT `Article 1(b) — the cancer benefit for` `carcinoma in situ` `has not yet been paid in` (LIST `early cancer paid 300 million`)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 2(b) — the early-stage condition` `minor burns` `has not yet been paid in` (LIST (`paid` (`the early-stage critical illness benefit for` `minor burns`) `of` 1))
#ASSERT `Article 2(b) — the early-stage condition` `corneal transplant` `has not yet been paid in` (LIST (`paid` (`the early-stage critical illness benefit for` `minor burns`) `of` 1))

§§ `Article 3 — ICU (src 190-227)`

GIVEN `days`     IS A NUMBER
      `cause`    IS A `Cause of ICU treatment`
      `provincial` IS A BOOLEAN
      `other`    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `ICU stay`
`an ICU stay of` `days` `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `cause` `, provincial:` `provincial` `, paid on other contracts` `other` MEANS `ICU stay` WITH
    `start date`                                          IS YMD 2024 5 1
    `consecutive days of treatment in the unit`           IS `days`
    `the direct cause`                                    IS `cause`
    `the unit`                                            IS `Intensive care unit` WITH
        `the hospital it belongs to` IS `Medical facility` WITH
            `established and operating under the law of Vietnam or of the host country`  IS TRUE
            `licensed as a hospital under the rules of Vietnam or of the host country`    IS TRUE
            `in Vietnam`                                                                  IS TRUE
            `its official seal shows the word for hospital`                               IS TRUE
            `its status is shown in the local language by a word understood as hospital`  IS TRUE
            `established for convalescence, nursing, elderly care, or alcohol or drug rehabilitation, or a similar purpose` IS FALSE
            `at provincial level or higher, or equivalent`                                IS `provincial`
        `established for special care and treatment`                       IS TRUE
        `reserved for critically ill patients needing a Doctor's continuous monitoring` IS TRUE
        `equipped to save patients' lives quickly`                         IS TRUE
        `a post-operative recovery room or an emergency room`              IS FALSE
    `ICU benefits already paid to the insured under the insured's other contracts` IS `other`

#ASSERT `Article 3(a) — the stay qualifies` (`an ICU stay of` 5 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `an Accident` `, provincial:` TRUE `, paid on other contracts` 0)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 3(a) — the stay qualifies` (`an ICU stay of` 4 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `an Accident` `, provincial:` TRUE `, paid on other contracts` 0)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 3(a) — the stay qualifies` (`an ICU stay of` 5 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `another illness` `, provincial:` FALSE `, paid on other contracts` 0)
#ASSERT `Article 3(a) — the stay qualifies` (`an ICU stay of` 5 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `a cancer or a critical illness as these rules and terms define them` `, provincial:` FALSE `, paid on other contracts` 0)
-- 30% of 1 billion = 300m; with 400m paid on other contracts the cap leaves 100m; with 500m, nothing.
#ASSERT `Article 3(a) — the ICU benefit on` `the account` `for` (`an ICU stay of` 5 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `an Accident` `, provincial:` TRUE `, paid on other contracts` 0) EQUALS 300 TIMES `one million`
#ASSERT `Article 3(a) — the ICU benefit on` `the account` `for` (`an ICU stay of` 5 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `an Accident` `, provincial:` TRUE `, paid on other contracts` (400 TIMES `one million`)) EQUALS 100 TIMES `one million`
#ASSERT `Article 3(a) — the ICU benefit on` `the account` `for` (`an ICU stay of` 5 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `an Accident` `, provincial:` TRUE `, paid on other contracts` (500 TIMES `one million`)) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Article 3(b) — under` `the policy` `, the principles allow the ICU benefit for` (`an ICU stay of` 5 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `an Accident` `, provincial:` TRUE `, paid on other contracts` 0) `after` EMPTY
#ASSERT NOT `Article 3(b) — under` `the policy` `, the principles allow the ICU benefit for` (`an ICU stay of` 5 `days from 1 May 2024, caused by` `an Accident` `, provincial:` TRUE `, paid on other contracts` 0) `after` (LIST (`paid` `the ICU benefit` `of` 1))

§§ `Articles 4, 5, 8, 9 — premium support, screening, loyalty, no-lapse (src 234-370)`

-- 200% of an annualised basic premium of 20 million.
#ASSERT `Article 4(a) — the premium-support benefit on` `the account` EQUALS 40 TIMES `one million`
#ASSERT `Article 4 — the premium-support benefit goes with` (`the cancer benefit for` `carcinoma in situ`) `after` EMPTY
#ASSERT NOT `Article 4 — the premium-support benefit goes with` (`the cancer benefit for` `major cancer`) `after` EMPTY
#ASSERT NOT `Article 4 — the premium-support benefit goes with` (`the early-stage critical illness benefit for` `minor burns`) `after` (LIST (`paid` `the premium-support benefit` `of` 1))

GIVEN `lapsed`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `lowest`  IS A NUMBER
      `withdrew` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Premium record`
`a record, lapsed:` `lapsed` `, lowest sum insured` `lowest` `, withdrew from basic:` `withdrew` MEANS `Premium record` WITH
    `the contract has ever lapsed`                                         IS `lapsed`
    `annual basic premium paid in full before each policy anniversary so far` IS TRUE
    `lowest sum insured during the term so far`                            IS `lowest`
    `basic premiums of the first 4 contract years paid in full`            IS TRUE
    `a withdrawal has ever been made from the basic account`               IS `withdrew`

