§§ `Article 23 — exclusions, each with a trigger and a near miss (src 691-762)`

-- (a)(i) Suicide: within 24 months of 15 March 2022 runs to 15 March 2024 inclusive.
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` `the policy` `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2024 3 15) `, given` (`circumstances: suicide` TRUE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE) EQUALS `the contract ends and the contract account value at death is paid`
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` `the policy` `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2024 3 16) `, given` (`circumstances: suicide` TRUE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE) EQUALS `the death benefit is paid`
-- The clock restarts at a reinstatement on 1 January 2023.
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` (`the policy, reinstated:` (JUST (YMD 2023 1 1))) `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2024 12 31) `, given` (`circumstances: suicide` TRUE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE) EQUALS `the contract ends and the contract account value at death is paid`
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` (`the policy, reinstated:` (JUST (YMD 2023 1 1))) `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2025 1 2) `, given` (`circumstances: suicide` TRUE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE) EQUALS `the death benefit is paid`
-- (a)(ii) Fraud by the policyowner: excluded; by a beneficiary: the innocent shares.
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` `the policy` `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2030 1 1) `, given` (`fraud by` `the policyowner, as fraudster`) EQUALS `the contract ends and the contract account value at death is paid`
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` `the policy` `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2030 1 1) `, given` (`fraud by` `a beneficiary, as fraudster`) EQUALS `only the beneficiaries who took no part in the fraud are paid, in their designated shares`
#ASSERT `Article 23(a)(ii) — the part of` (1000 TIMES `one million`) `paid to the beneficiaries among` (LIST (Beneficiary WITH `designated share` IS 0.6, `took part in the insurance fraud` IS TRUE, `died before or at the same time as the insured` IS FALSE), (Beneficiary WITH `designated share` IS 0.4, `took part in the insurance fraud` IS FALSE, `died before or at the same time as the insured` IS FALSE)) `who took no part` EQUALS 400 TIMES `one million`
-- (b) TPD: alcohol excludes; a named dangerous activity excludes; scheduled commercial flight does not; a private flight does.
#ASSERT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`circumstances: suicide` FALSE `, alcohol` TRUE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` `no circumstances`
#ASSERT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`circumstances: suicide` FALSE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` (JUST `bungee jumping`) `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`circumstances: suicide` FALSE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` (JUST `another sport or recreational activity`) `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`circumstances: suicide` FALSE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` TRUE `, scheduled` TRUE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`circumstances: suicide` FALSE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` FALSE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` TRUE `, scheduled` FALSE)
-- Medicine without a prescription excludes cancer and critical illness, but is not in the TPD list.
#ASSERT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `is excluded, given` (`circumstances: suicide` FALSE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` TRUE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`circumstances: suicide` FALSE `, alcohol` FALSE `, medicine` TRUE `, activity` NOTHING `, air` FALSE `, scheduled` FALSE)
-- (c)(i) 90 days from acceptance on 20 March 2022 runs to 18 June 2022 inclusive.
#ASSERT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2022 6 18) `is excluded, given` `no circumstances`
#ASSERT NOT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2022 6 19) `is excluded, given` `no circumstances`

§§ `Article 24 — termination (src 764-847)`

-- Three early-stage payments of 300m total 900m: under 100% of 1 billion. A fourth makes 1 200m.
`three early payments` MEANS LIST `early cancer paid 300 million`,
                                  (`paid` (`the cancer benefit for` `carcinoma in situ`) `of` (300 TIMES `one million`)),
                                  (`paid` (`the early-stage critical illness benefit for` `minor burns`) `of` (300 TIMES `one million`))
#ASSERT NOT `Article 24(a)(iii) — on` `the account` `, the early-stage benefits in` `three early payments` `have reached 100% of the sum insured`
#ASSERT `Article 24(a)(iii) — on` `the account` `, the early-stage benefits in` ((`paid` (`the early-stage critical illness benefit for` `corneal transplant`) `of` (300 TIMES `one million`)) FOLLOWED BY `three early payments`) `have reached 100% of the sum insured`
-- Refund on (a)(iii): max(0, 1 200m - 1 000m) + 50m = 250m; with a basic of 200m, 50m.
#ASSERT `Article 24(a)(iii) — the refund when the early-stage benefits reach 100%, on` (`an account of sum insured` `one billion` `, basic` (1200 TIMES `one million`) `, top-up` (50 TIMES `one million`) `, debts` 0) EQUALS 250 TIMES `one million`
#ASSERT `Article 24(a)(iii) — the refund when the early-stage benefits reach 100%, on` `the account` EQUALS 50 TIMES `one million`
#ASSERT `Article 24(c) — the value paid on early termination at the customer's request, on` (`an account of sum insured` `one billion` `, basic` (200 TIMES `one million`) `, top-up` (50 TIMES `one million`) `, debts` (10 TIMES `one million`)) EQUALS 240 TIMES `one million`
-- After a major cancer, only extended major cancer remains.
#ASSERT NOT `Article 24 — the contract still provides` `the death benefit` `, on` `the account` `, after` (LIST (`paid` (`the cancer benefit for` `major cancer`) `of` 1))
#ASSERT `Article 24 — the contract still provides` (`the cancer benefit for` `extended major cancer`) `, on` `the account` `, after` (LIST (`paid` (`the cancer benefit for` `major cancer`) `of` 1))
#ASSERT NOT `Article 24 — the contract still provides` `the ICU benefit` `, on` `the account` `, after` (LIST (`paid` `the TPD benefit` `of` 1))
#ASSERT `Article 24 — the contract still provides` `the ICU benefit` `, on` `the account` `, after` `three early payments`
-- The extended cover ends on the anniversary after the 85th birthday (2065-06-10): 2066-03-15.
#ASSERT `Article 24(b)(iii) — the end of the extended cover of` `the policy` EQUALS YMD 2066 3 15
#ASSERT `Article 24(a)(vi) — on` (YMD 2025 3 16) `the contract has been lapsed for more than 24 months since` (YMD 2023 3 15)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 24(a)(vi) — on` (YMD 2025 3 15) `the contract has been lapsed for more than 24 months since` (YMD 2023 3 15)

§§ `Claims assessed end to end — the layers interacting`

GIVEN `the payments` IS A LIST OF `Payment already made`
      `in force`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `the circumstances` IS A `Circumstances of the insured event`
GIVETH A `Claim context`
`a claim context after` `the payments` `, in force:` `in force` `, circumstances` `the circumstances` MEANS `Claim context` WITH
    `the policy`                         IS `the policy`
    `the account at the event`           IS `the account`
    `benefits already paid`              IS `the payments`
    `in force on the date of the event`  IS `in force`
    `the circumstances`                  IS `the circumstances`

GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE
      `invasive` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Diagnosis of cancer`
`a cancer diagnosed on` `the date` `, invasive:` `invasive` MEANS `Diagnosis of cancer` WITH
    `date of diagnosis`  IS `the date`
    `the cancer findings` IS `Findings on a cancer` WITH
        `diagnosed by an oncologist`                                        IS TRUE
        `confirmed by histopathology or anatomical pathology`               IS TRUE
        `confirmed positive on a biopsy examined under a microscope`        IS TRUE
        `diagnosed from clinical signs only`                                IS FALSE
        `new cancer cells confined to the primary site, not invading or destroying surrounding tissue` IS FALSE
        `uncontrolled growth of malignant cells invading surrounding tissue` IS `invasive`
        `a malignant tumour, leukaemia, lymphoma or sarcoma`                IS `invasive`
        `histological classification`                                       IS `none of the classes the exclusions name`
        `RAI stage of chronic lymphocytic leukaemia`                        IS NOTHING
        `primary site`                                                      IS `the prostate`
        `a melanoma`                                                        IS FALSE
        `described histologically as in situ`                               IS FALSE
        `invading beyond the epidermis`                                     IS FALSE
        `spread to lymph nodes or distant sites`                            IS FALSE
        `TNM T1N0M0 or lower, or an equivalent or lower classification`     IS FALSE
        `mitotic count per 50 high-power fields`                            IS 0
        `in a person infected with HIV`                                     IS FALSE

-- A non-invasive prostate cancer that is neither carcinoma in situ nor major: early-stage, 300m.
#ASSERT `the cancer benefit on` (`a cancer diagnosed on` (YMD 2024 1 10) `, invasive:` FALSE) `in` (`a claim context after` EMPTY `, in force:` TRUE `, circumstances` `no circumstances`) EQUALS `payable` (300 TIMES `one million`)
-- Then a major cancer: 1 000m + 50m - 300m already paid = 750m.
#ASSERT `the cancer benefit on` (`a cancer diagnosed on` (YMD 2025 1 10) `, invasive:` TRUE) `in` (`a claim context after` (LIST `early cancer paid 300 million`) `, in force:` TRUE `, circumstances` `no circumstances`) EQUALS `payable` (750 TIMES `one million`)
-- The same early-stage cancer inside the 90 days, or a second time, or with the contract lapsed.
#ASSERT `the cancer benefit on` (`a cancer diagnosed on` (YMD 2022 6 1) `, invasive:` FALSE) `in` (`a claim context after` EMPTY `, in force:` TRUE `, circumstances` `no circumstances`) EQUALS `not payable, because` "Article 23(c): excluded"
#ASSERT `the cancer benefit on` (`a cancer diagnosed on` (YMD 2025 1 10) `, invasive:` FALSE) `in` (`a claim context after` (LIST `early cancer paid 300 million`) `, in force:` TRUE `, circumstances` `no circumstances`) EQUALS `not payable, because` "Article 1(b): this cancer benefit has already been paid once"
